s mother. The very person who taught Yukari various techniques. Her body, radiating an ageless, mature allure, remains in fine form."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's quite the airhead, yet surprisingly sharp at times. A good confidante to Toshiya, she offers sincere advice whenever needed."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She believes improving one's sexual technique is proof of love for one's partner."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59453"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゆかり母。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゆかりに様々なテクニックを伝授した張本人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年齢を感じさせない、大人の色香を漂わす身体は健在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かなりの天然さんなのだが意外に鋭い一面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"俊也の良き理解者で何かと親身になって相談に乗ってくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"セックスのテクニック向上はパートナーへの愛情の証だと思っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16827","sourceWorkId":"24812","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゆかりの母。ということは、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結構な歳のはずなのだが、とてもそうは見えない人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゆかりに様々なテクニックを伝授した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目なのか呆けているのか判らない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"54203"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dcaa7ceceab24d9c52f3f22610f7b9e2e412ca21694b85b09fd0f12e45ca7d55.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d7c625305d93a1d1df4ab7fe0a71023bba94c72a3120ac5026ab0b4b33298d1c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"霜月 優","creatorId":"vndb:s2685","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2685","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2685","name":"霜月 優","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:73253","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c59454","characterName":"遠山 香織","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"54204","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"211831"}],"eg